# Grade Calculator

A simple Java-based Grade Calculator that accepts student details and marks, calculates the average score, and displays the highest and lowest scores along with the corresponding grades.

## Features

* Accepts details of multiple students
* Stores student names and marks
* Calculates average score
* Finds highest score
* Finds lowest score
* Assigns grades based on marks
* Displays a student grade report

## Technologies Used

* Java
* Object-Oriented Programming
* Java Collections

## How to Run

1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Open the project in IntelliJ IDEA or any Java IDE.
3. Compile and run the main Java class.
4. Enter the number of students and their marks.
5. View the generated grade report.

## Sample Output

```text
========== STUDENT GRADE REPORT ==========

Name: Srushti | Marks: 85.0 | Grade: A
Name: Shiv | Marks: 100.0 | Grade: A+

-------------------------------------------
Average Score : 92.50
Highest Score : 100.00
Lowest Score  : 85.00
===========================================
```

## Project Purpose

This project was developed to practice Java programming concepts such as classes, objects, arrays/collections, loops, conditional statements, methods, and basic data processing.
